sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant F as Form/Website
  participant G as Ingestion Gateway
  participant Q as Redis Queue
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant S as Sales Agent
  participant M as MCP Gateway
  participant P as Policy Service
  participant C as Founder Console
  F->>G: POST /webhooks/form (HMAC)
  G->>G: Xác thực chữ ký, chuẩn hóa, dedupe
  G->>Q: publish event lead.created
  Q->>O: consume event
  O->>O: Tạo TASK(sales.qualify_lead)
  O->>S: giao task + context (CRM, ICP)
  S->>M: crm.search / web.research(company)
  M-->>S: dữ liệu làm giàu
  S->>S: chấm điểm lead, soạn email cá nhân hóa
  S->>P: check(action=email.send, risk)
  alt Lead score < 70 (rủi ro thấp, L2)
    P-->>S: allow
    S->>M: email.send + crm.update
  else Lead lớn / có báo giá (L1)
    P-->>S: require_approval
    S->>C: tạo APPROVAL (nháp email)
    C-->>P: Founder duyệt / sửa
    P->>M: email.send (bản đã duyệt)
  end
  S-->>O: kết quả + chi phí
  O->>Q: publish task.completed
